					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Eh, some charming exchange between the various BQs aside, there wasn't a whole bunch here for me as a reader.</p> <p>All in all I found the article to be a rather plain info dump that doesn't really explore any of the alternate timelines to a satisfactory degree, perhaps if there were a few more examples to fill out the spectrum then things would be different, but as is there isn't enough here to really pull me in.</p> <p>-1, I'm afraid.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
